Package: ollama
Version: @DEB_VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: windenntw <windenntw@gmail.com>
Depends: curl, ca-certificates, zstd
Recommends: pciutils
Suggests: nvidia-driver | cuda-drivers
Description: Ollama - get up and running with large language models (installer).
 Downloads and installs Ollama during package installation, configures the
 ollama system user and systemd service, and installs AMD ROCm libraries
 when an AMD GPU is detected.
